l API endpoints. The architecture ensures permission -based access control and \\nsecure document handling.  \\nTechnology Stack:  \\n \\n\\u2022 Technologies:  \\no Node.js & Express.js: Server -side runtime and web framework  \\no TypeScript: Type -safe development with improved maintainab\\n\\nAD integration with proper token \\nmanagement  \\nFile Type Security: Restricting downloads to safe file types only  \\nSearch Performance: Implementing efficient search across multiple SharePoint sites and \\ndrives  \\nSession Security: Managing secure token storage and session handling  \\nCross -Platform Compatibility: Ensuring the solution works across different operating \\nsystems  \\nTechnical Solution:  \\nA TypeScript -based Node.js application that serves as a secure bridge between AI systems \\nand Sha\\n\\nment:  \\no   \\no Local development with hot -reloading  \\no TypeScript compilation pipeline  \\no Environment -based configuration  \\no Production Ready:  \\no   \\no Cross -platform deployment support  \\no Secure session management  \\no HTTPS enforcement capabilities  \\no Configurable port and environment settings  \\no Security Infrastructure:  \\no   \\no Content Security Policy headers  \\no Secure cookie configuration  \\no Session -based authentication  \\no Permission -based access control  \\n \\n \\n \\n \\n \\n \\n \\n \\n \\nArc\\n\\n\\nUser Question: Hi Can you please help me with more information about logiquad.\\n\\nAnswer:"}], "max_completion_tokens": 2000, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9}', 'url': 'https://bedrock-runtime.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/model/openai.gpt-oss-20b-1%3A0/invoke', 'context': {'client_region': 'us-west-2', 'client_config': <botocore.config.Config object at 0x0000029A2B7C4050>, 'has_streaming_input': True, 'auth_type': None, 'unsigned_payload': None, 'auth_options': ['aws.auth#sigv4', 'smithy.api#httpBearerAuth']}}
